      "get": {
        "summary": "查询VDC列表",
        "x-resource": "租户管理",
        "description": "查询VDC列表,支持按照region查询,可以查询VDC下级列表,支持分页和排序。\n\ncurl命令调用示例:\n```\ncurl -i -H \"Accept: application/json\" -H \"x-auth-token: ******\" -X GET \"https://{endpoint}/rest/vdc/v3.0/vdcs?start=0&limit=10\"\n```\n\n|SLA项|定义|\n|-----|-----|\n|请求成功率| >=99.9%|\n|可用性|Tier1|\n|数据一致性|最终一致,不一致时长<1分钟|\n|吞吐量|240次/分钟|\n|吞吐量|20次/秒|\n|TP50请求时延|1500ms|\n|TP99.9请求时延|3000ms|",
        "x-precautions": "错误码:当请求不成功时,响应体内的错误码信息请参见“ManageOne 运营面API参考 > 错误码说明 > VDC特性”章节。",
        "tags": [
          "VDC"
        ],
        "operationId": "ListVDCs",
        "produces": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "consumes": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "x-auth-token",
            "in": "header",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "description": "接口支持的用户token。运营管理员,机机账号权限,VDC管理员权限用户的token。"
          },
          {
            "name": "start",
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int32",
            "in": "query",
            "default": 0,
            "description": "分页查询的起始位置,取值在0-2147483647之间,默认从0开始。"
          },
          {
            "name": "limit",
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int32",
            "in": "query",
            "default": 20,
            "description": "限制每页显示的条目数量,取值在0-1000之间。"
          },
          {
            "name": "name",
            "type": "string",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "VDC名称,长度在0-128之间。"
          },
          {
            "name": "tag",
            "type": "string",
            "in": "query",
            "enum": [
              "vdc",
              "nfvo"
            ],
            "description": "租户类型。"
          },
          {
            "name": "region_id",
            "type": "string",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "地域标识,长度在1-32位,包含数字字母中划线。"
          },
          {
            "name": "az_id",
            "type": "string",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "available zone 标识,长度1-128之间。"
          },
          {
            "name": "upper_vdc_id",
            "type": "string",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "上级VDC id,只能包含小写字母、数字、中划线,长度在1-36之间。"
          },
          {
            "name": "domain_id",
            "type": "string",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "域标识,长度在1-36之间。"
          },
          {
            "name": "level",
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int32",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "VDC级别,取值在1-5之间。"
          },
          {
            "name": "sort_key",
            "type": "string",
            "in": "query",
            "default": "name",
            "description": "排序字段,支持按create_at、name字段排序。"
          },
          {
            "name": "sort_dir",
            "type": "string",
            "in": "query",
            "default": "asc",
            "enum": [
              "asc",
              "desc"
            ],
            "description": "排序方向,取值范围asc,desc。"
          },
          {
            "name": "start_time",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "查询开始时间,正确的时间格式例如2017-12-20 08:34:26。",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "end_time",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "查询结束时间,正确的时间格式例如2017-12-20 08:34:26。",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "is_domain",
            "type": "string",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "是否为租户,1代表是,0代表不是。"
          },
          {
            "name": "query_name",
            "type": "string",
            "in": "query",
            "enum": [
              "domainName",
              "upperVdcName",
              "extra"
            ],
            "description": "过滤字段名称。"
          },
          {
            "name": "query_value",
            "type": "string",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "过滤字段值。"
          },
          {
            "name": "used",
            "type": "boolean",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "是否查询ECS/EVS使用量。"
          },
          {
            "name": "contain_manager",
            "type": "boolean",
            "in": "query",
            "default": true,
            "description": "是否包含业务主管信息。"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
